{
  "comment": [
    "Recorded with -agentlib:native-image-agent against the shipped jar (--demo, every API route, the UI",
    "and its assets), then edited by hand. See spec/GRAALVM.md section 4.",
    "",
    "The engine's own FFM registrations live in graph-core's copy of this file, not here. The two below",
    "belong to netty's CleanerJava24Linker \u2014 malloc(3) as jlong(jlong) and free(3) as void(jlong) \u2014",
    "reached through the substitution in src/nativeimage/java. A 'comment' inside a downcall entry is a",
    "parse error, which is why this says it up here.",
    "",
    "The last resource entry is webroot/**, the bundled browser UI. The agent only records the files a",
    "run happens to request, which was index.html and nothing under assets/."
  ],
